## Infrastructure Architecture
```
Azure Resources:
├── Container Registry (kyndexacr)
├── Container Apps Environment
│   ├── Frontend (Next.js on port 3000)
│   └── Backend (NestJS on port 3001)
├── PostgreSQL Database (Flexible Server)
├── Key Vault (for secrets)
├── Application Insights (monitoring)
├── Log Analytics Workspace
└── Managed Identity (OIDC authentication)

GitHub:
├── Repository Secrets: AZURE_CLIENT_ID, AZURE_TENANT_ID, AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID
├── Environment: dev (auto-deploy from develop branch)
└── Environment: prod (auto-deploy from main branch)
```

## Next Steps to Complete Deployment
1. Ensure GitHub and Azure CLI are installed
2. Run: `.azure/setup-azure-auth-for-pipeline.ps1`
3. Commit all changes to GitHub
4. Push to `develop` or `main` branch
5. Monitor deployment in GitHub Actions

